        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>TC901 Series Low Profile Residential Door Closer</b>\r\n<p>\r\nOne of our few door closers available in White !\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe TC901 is a low profile, residential door closer for any door up to 150 pounds  and 36 inches wide. Perfect for storm doors, front, rear or side entry doors, utility room doors,  or any door where self closing is desired. When used on screen or storm doors it  only requires 2-1/8\" clearance between doors for mounting.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nEasy to install with No special tools required. Reversible for left or right hand doors. Applicable for out swinging or in swinging doors. Hold Open feature (locks door in the open position when needed).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Compact design, fits flush and does not intrude into room. Keep energy, kids and pets in - insects and pests out. It uses a Gas Spring - no metal springs to squeak or wear out, no oil to leak. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of TC901 Residential Door Closer\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Closer Body Length: 9-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Closer Body Height: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Track Length: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height (Closer Body & Track): 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Weight: Up to 150 lbs.</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Door Width: Up to 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Opening: 110 degrees</li>\r\n<li>Closer Housing: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 2 Year Manufacture Warranty</li>\r\n<li>Hold Open (holds door open at approximately 105 degrees)</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/TC901-install.pdf?v=1704262175\" target=\"new\"><b>TC901 Closer Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/TC901-template.pdf?v=1704262174\" target=\"new\"><b>TC901 Closer Installation Templates (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/omnia-16000-series-size.gif?v=1704442272\" width=\"550\" height=\"406\" border=\"0\" alt=\"TC901 How to Install\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p> <b>Available in either Dark Brown, Light Bronze or White color finish.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n <!-- <p><br><b>** The White finish</b> is on <b>Back Order</b> from the manufacture. The current expected shipping date is <b>11/5/20</b>\r\n</p> -->",
