                "description": "Global TC901 Series Door Closer - \r\nThe TC901 is a low profile, residential door closer for any door up to 150 pounds and 36 inch wide door. Easy to install  No special tools required. Reversible for left or right hand doors. Applicable for out swinging / in swinging doors. Available with hold open feature. Available in White, Dark Brown or Light Bronze  color.\r\n\r\n  ",
